    - Term: SignIn/Privacy
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "<b>Privacy and Terms of Usage</b>\n\nWe hereby inform you that\nPlus Games
        SARL collects,\nstores and transmit the following\npersonal data:\n\n- Installed
        apps (including the\nuse duration and use history)\n\n- Registration data
        (IP address, \nDevice ID, email)\n\n- Location (approximate)\n\n- Data for
        Attribution (User Agent,\nAD ID, Device ID)\n\n- Data for Personalised Ads\n(cookies,
        IDs)\n\nThe data will be connected to\nyour end device via the device ID
        and\nsent to our servers. In\norder for app providers to finance our\napp\nsuggestions,
        we must send\nthem the\ndevice ID for billing purposes.\n\nThe processing
        of the above\ndata is\nnecessary to be able to\nrecommend, via\nsystem messages,
        the\ninstallation of\napps available in Playtime\nthat match\nyour interests,
        and calculate\nthe\nbonuses acquired as a result\nof your\nuse of the corresponding\napps.\n\n**Consent**\n\nBy
        clicking on \u201CACCEPT\u201D, I give Plus Games SARL and adjoe GmbH my
        consent to process my above mentioned personal data and transmit it to other
        app providers so that I can use Playtime as described.\n\nl am aware that
        a profile of\ninterests will\nbe generated using the above\ndata, and\ndepending
        on the types of\napps I use,\nthis may contain particularly\nsensitive\npersonal
        data (e.g.\nhealth-related data or\ndata about my sexual orientation, and
        any other data in special categories\npursuant to Art. 9[1] GDPR). For\nthat\nreason
        my consent also\napplies\nexplicitly to the processing of\nthis data.\n\nThe
        full links to our <u><link=\u201Chttps://plus-games.com/rewardee-privacy\u201D>Privacy\nPolicy</link></u>,<u>\n<link=\u201Chttps://plus-games.com/rewardee-terms\u201D>Terms
        Of Use</link></u> and Adjoe's <u><link=\u201Chttps://adjoe.zone/legal/en/data_privacy.html\u201D>Data\nPrivacy
        Statement</link></u> and <u><link=\u201Chttps://adjoe.zone/legal/en/terms_of_use.html\u201D>Terms\nand
        Conditions of use</link></u>."
      - "<b>Privacy and Terms of Usage</b>\n\nWe hereby inform you that\nPlus Games
        SARL collects,\nstores and transmit the following\npersonal data:\n\n- Installed
        apps (including the\nuse duration and use history)\n\n- Registration data
        (IP address, \nDevice ID, email)\n\n- Location (approximate)\n\n- Data for
        Attribution (User Agent,\nAD ID, Device ID)\n\n- Data for Personalised Ads\n(cookies,
        IDs)\n\nThe data will be connected to\nyour end device via the device ID
        and\nsent to our servers. In\norder for app providers to finance our\napp\nsuggestions,
        we must send\nthem the\ndevice ID for billing purposes.\n\nThe processing
        of the above\ndata is\nnecessary to be able to\nrecommend, via\nsystem messages,
        the\ninstallation of\napps available in Playtime\nthat match\nyour interests,
        and calculate\nthe\nbonuses acquired as a result\nof your\nuse of the corresponding\napps.\n\n**Consent**\n\nBy
        clicking on \u201CACCEPT\u201D, I give Plus Games SARL and adjoe GmbH my
        consent to process my above mentioned personal data and transmit it to other
        app providers so that I can use Playtime as described.\n\nl am aware that
        a profile of\ninterests will\nbe generated using the above\ndata, and\ndepending
        on the types of\napps I use,\nthis may contain particularly\nsensitive\npersonal
        data (e.g.\nhealth-related data or\ndata about my sexual orientation, and
        any other data in special categories\npursuant to Art. 9[1] GDPR). For\nthat\nreason
        my consent also\napplies\nexplicitly to the processing of\nthis data.\n\nThe
        full links to our <u><link=\u201Chttps://plus-games.com/rewardee-terms\u201D>Privacy\nPolicy</link></u>,<u>\n<link=\u201Chttps://plus-games.com/rewardee-terms\u201D>Terms
        Of Use</link></u> and Adjoe's <u><link=\u201Chttps://adjoe.zone/legal/en/data_privacy.html\u201D>Data\nPrivacy
        Statement</link></u> and <u><link=\u201Chttps://adjoe.zone/legal/en/terms_of_use.html\u201D>Terms\nand
        Conditions of use</link></u>."
      - "<b>Privacy and Terms of Usage</b>\n\nWe hereby inform you that\nPlus Games
        SARL collects,\nstores and transmit the following\npersonal data:\n\n- Installed
        apps (including the\nuse duration and use history)\n\n- Registration data
        (IP address, \nDevice ID, email)\n\n- Location (approximate)\n\n- Data for
        Attribution (User Agent,\nAD ID, Device ID)\n\n- Data for Personalised Ads\n(cookies,
        IDs)\n\nThe data will be connected to\nyour end device via the device ID
        and\nsent to our servers. In\norder for app providers to finance our\napp\nsuggestions,
        we must send\nthem the\ndevice ID for billing purposes.\n\nThe processing
        of the above\ndata is\nnecessary to be able to\nrecommend, via\nsystem messages,
        the\ninstallation of\napps available in Playtime\nthat match\nyour interests,
        and calculate\nthe\nbonuses acquired as a result\nof your\nuse of the corresponding\napps.\n\n**Consent**\n\nBy
        clicking on \u201CACCEPT\u201D, I give Plus Games SARL and adjoe GmbH my
        consent to process my above mentioned personal data and transmit it to other
        app providers so that I can use Playtime as described.\n\nl am aware that
        a profile of\ninterests will\nbe generated using the above\ndata, and\ndepending
        on the types of\napps I use,\nthis may contain particularly\nsensitive\npersonal
        data (e.g.\nhealth-related data or\ndata about my sexual orientation, and
        any other data in special categories\npursuant to Art. 9[1] GDPR). For\nthat\nreason
        my consent also\napplies\nexplicitly to the processing of\nthis data.\n\nThe
        full links to our <u><link=\u201Chttps://plus-games.com/rewardee-terms\u201D>Privacy\nPolicy</link></u>,<u>\n<link=\u201Chttps://plus-games.com/rewardee-terms\u201D>Terms
        Of Use</link></u> and Adjoe's <u><link=\u201Chttps://adjoe.zone/legal/en/data_privacy.html\u201D>Data\nPrivacy
        Statement</link></u> and <u><link=\u201Chttps://adjoe.zone/legal/en/terms_of_use.html\u201D>Terms\nand
        Conditions of use</link></u>."
      - "<b>Confidentialit\xE9 et conditions d'utilisation</b>\n\nNous vous informons
        par la pr\xE9sente que\nAdjoe GmbH, traite les\ndonn\xE9es personnelles suivantes\ndans
        le cadre de l'utilisation de\nPlaytime\_:\n\n<b>Applications install\xE9es
        (y compris la\ndur\xE9e d'utilisation et l'historique d'utilisation)</b>\n\nLes
        donn\xE9es seront connect\xE9es \xE0\nvotre appareil final via l'ID de l'appareil
        et\nenvoy\xE9es,\ncrypt\xE9es, \xE0 nos serveurs.\nPour que\nles fournisseurs
        d'applications puissent\nfinancer nos\nsuggestions d'applications, nous\ndevons
        leur envoyer l'ID de l'appareil \xE0 des fins de facturation.\n\nLe traitement
        des\ndonn\xE9es ci-dessus est\nn\xE9cessaire pour pouvoir\nrecommander, via\ndes\nmessages
        syst\xE8me, l'installation\nd'applications\ndisponibles dans Playtime\nqui\ncorrespondent\n\xE0
        vos int\xE9r\xEAts, et calculer\nles\nbonus acquis suite\n\xE0 votre\nutilisation
        du\napplications correspondantes.\n\n<b>Consentement</b>\n\nEn cliquant sur
        \xAB\_ACCEPTER\_\xBB, je donne mon consentement \xE0 adjoe GmbH pour traiter
        mes donn\xE9es personnelles mentionn\xE9es ci-dessus et les transmettre \xE0
        d'autres fournisseurs d'applications afin que je puisse utiliser Playtime
        comme d\xE9crit.\n\nJe suis conscient qu'un profil d'int\xE9r\xEAts\nsera\ng\xE9n\xE9r\xE9
        \xE0 l'aide des donn\xE9es\nci-dessus, et\nselon les types d'applications
        que j'utilise,\ncela peut contenir des donn\xE9es personnelles particuli\xE8rement\nsensibles
        (par exemple\ndes donn\xE9es relatives \xE0 la sant\xE9 ou\ndes donn\xE9es
        sur mon orientation sexuelle, ainsi que toute autre donn\xE9e dans des cat\xE9gories\nsp\xE9ciales
        conform\xE9ment \xE0 l'art. 9[1] du RGPD). Pour\ncette\nraison, mon consentement\ns'applique
        \xE9galement\nexplicitement au traitement\nde ces donn\xE9es.\n\nLes liens
        complets vers notre <u><link=\u201Chttps://plus-games.com/rewardee-privacy\u201D>Politique\nde\nconfidentialit\xE9</link></u>,<u>\n<link=\u201Chttps://plus-games.com/rewardee-terms\u201D>Conditions\nd'utilisation</link></u>
        et la <u><link=\u201Chttps://adjoe.zone/legal/en/data_privacy.html\u201D>D\xE9claration\nde\nconfidentialit\xE9\ndes\ndonn\xE9es</link></u>
        et les <u><link=\u201Chttps://adjoe.zone/legal/en/terms_of_use.html\u201D>Conditions\ng\xE9n\xE9rales\nd'utilisation</link></u>
        d'Adjoe."
      - "<b>Privacidad y condiciones de uso</b>\n\nTe informamos de que\nAdjoe GmbH
        procesa los siguientes\ndatos personales\nen el marco del\nuso de Playtime:\n\n<b>Aplicaciones
        instaladas (incluida la\nduraci\xF3n de uso y el historial de uso)</b>\n\nLos
        datos se conectar\xE1n a\ntu dispositivo final a trav\xE9s del ID del dispositivo
        y se\nenviar\xE1n,\nencriptados, a nuestros servidores. Para\nque los proveedores
        de\naplicaciones financien nuestras\nsugerencias de aplicaciones, debemos\nenviarles
        el ID del dispositivo para fines de facturaci\xF3n.\n\nEl procesamiento de
        los\ndatos anteriores es\nnecesario para poder\nrecomendar, a trav\xE9s de\nmensajes
        del sistema, la\ninstalaci\xF3n de\naplicaciones disponibles en Playtime\nque
        coincidan\ncon tus intereses, y calcular\nlas bonificaciones adquiridas como
        resultado\nde tu\nuso de las\naplicaciones correspondientes.\n\n<b>Consentimiento</b>\n\nAl
        hacer clic en \u201CACEPTAR\u201D, doy mi consentimiento a adjoe GmbH para
        procesar mis datos personales mencionados anteriormente y transmitirlos a
        otros proveedores de aplicaciones para que pueda utilizar Playtime como se
        describe.\n\nSoy consciente de que se generar\xE1 un perfil\nde intereses\na
        partir de los datos anteriores y,\nseg\xFAn el tipo de\naplicaciones que
        utilice,\neste puede contener datos personales\nespecialmente\nsensibles
        (p. ej.,\ndatos relacionados con la salud o\ndatos sobre mi orientaci\xF3n
        sexual, as\xED como cualquier otro dato en categor\xEDas especiales\nde conformidad
        con el art. 9[1] del RGPD). Por\nese\nmotivo, mi consentimiento tambi\xE9n
        se aplica\nexpl\xEDcitamente al procesamiento\nde estos datos.\n\nLos enlaces
        completos a nuestra <u><link=\u201Chttps://plus-games.com/rewardee-privacy\u201D>Pol\xEDtica\nde
        Privacidad</link></u>,<u>\n<link=\u201Chttps://plus-games.com/rewardee-terms\u201D>Condiciones\nde
        Uso</link></u> y la <u><link=\u201Chttps://adjoe.zone/legal/es/privacy_data.html\u201D>Declaraci\xF3n\nde
        Privacidad de Datos</link></u> y los <u><link=\u201Chttps://adjoe.zone/legal/es/terms_of_use.html\u201D>T\xE9rminos\ny
        Condiciones de Uso</link></u> de Adjoe."
      - "<b>Privacy and Terms of Usage</b>\n\nWe hereby inform you that\nAdjoe GmbH,
        processes the following\npersonal data\nwithin the framework of the\nuse
        of\nPlaytime:\n\n<b>Installed apps (including the\nuse duration and use history)</b>\n\nThe
        data will be connected to\nyour end device via the device ID and\nsent,\nencrypted,
        to our servers. In\norder for\napp providers to finance our\napp\nsuggestions,
        we must send\nthem the\ndevice ID for billing purposes.\n\nThe processing
        of the above\ndata is\nnecessary to be able to\nrecommend, via\nsystem messages,
        the\ninstallation of\napps available in Playtime\nthat match\nyour interests,
        and calculate\nthe\nbonuses acquired as a result\nof your\nuse of the corresponding\napps.\n\n<b>Consent</b>\n\nBy
        clicking on \u201CACCEPT\u201D, I give adjoe GmbH my consent to process my
        above mentioned personal data and transmit it to other app providers so that
        I can use Playtime as described.\n\nl am aware that a profile of\ninterests
        will\nbe generated using the above\ndata, and\ndepending on the types of\napps
        I use,\nthis may contain particularly\nsensitive\npersonal data (e.g.\nhealth-related
        data or\ndata about my sexual orientation, and any other data in special
        categories\npursuant to Art. 9[1] GDPR). For\nthat\nreason my consent also\napplies\nexplicitly
        to the processing of\nthis data.\n\nThe full links to our <u><link=\u201Chttps://plus-games.com/rewardee-privacy\u201D>Privacy\nPolicy</link></u>,<u>\n<link=\u201Chttps://plus-games.com/plus-test-terms\u201D>Terms
        Of Use</link></u> and Adjoe's <u><link=\u201Chttps://adjoe.zone/legal/en/data_privacy.html\u201D>Data\nPrivacy
        Statement</link></u> and <u><link=\u201Chttps://adjoe.zone/legal/en/terms_of_use.html\u201D>Terms\nand
        Conditions of use</link></u>."
      - "<b>Privacidade e condi\xE7\xF5es de uso</b>\n\nInformamos que a\nAdjoe GmbH
        processa os seguintes\ndados pessoais\nno \xE2mbito do\nuso do Playtime:\n\n<b>Aplicativos
        instalados (incluindo a\ndura\xE7\xE3o de uso e o hist\xF3rico de uso)</b>\n\nOs
        dados ser\xE3o vinculados ao\nseu dispositivo final por meio do ID do dispositivo
        e ser\xE3o\nenviados,\ncriptografados, aos nossos servidores. Para\nque os
        provedores de\naplicativos financiem nossas\nsugest\xF5es de aplicativos,
        precisamos\nenviar a eles o ID do dispositivo para fins de faturamento.\n\nO
        processamento dos\ndados acima \xE9\nnecess\xE1rio para poder\nrecomendar,
        por meio de\nmensagens do sistema, a\ninstala\xE7\xE3o de\naplicativos dispon\xEDveis
        no Playtime\nque correspondam\naos seus interesses, e calcular\nos b\xF4nus
        adquiridos como resultado\ndo seu\nuso dos\naplicativos correspondentes.\n\n<b>Consentimento</b>\n\nAo
        clicar em \u201CACEITAR\u201D, dou meu consentimento \xE0 adjoe GmbH para
        processar meus dados pessoais mencionados acima e transmiti-los a outros
        provedores de aplicativos para que eu possa utilizar o Playtime conforme
        descrito.\n\nEstou ciente de que ser\xE1 gerado um perfil\nde interesses\na
        partir dos dados acima e,\ndependendo do tipo de\naplicativos que eu utilizar,\nisso
        poder\xE1 conter dados pessoais\nespecialmente\nsens\xEDveis (por ex.,\ndados
        relacionados \xE0 sa\xFAde ou\ndados sobre minha orienta\xE7\xE3o sexual,
        assim como quaisquer outros dados em categorias especiais\nem conformidade
        com o art. 9[1] do RGPD). Por\nesse\nmotivo, meu consentimento tamb\xE9m
        se aplica\nexplicitamente ao processamento\ndesses dados.\n\nOs links completos
        para nossa <u><link=\u201Chttps://plus-games.com/rewardee-privacy\u201D>Pol\xEDtica\nde
        Privacidade</link></u>,<u>\n<link=\u201Chttps://plus-games.com/rewardee-terms\u201D>Condi\xE7\xF5es\nde
        Uso</link></u> e a <u><link=\u201Chttps://adjoe.zone/legal/es/privacy_data.html\u201D>Declara\xE7\xE3o\nde
        Privacidade de Dados</link></u> e os <u><link=\u201Chttps://adjoe.zone/legal/es/terms_of_use.html\u201D>Termos\ne
        Condi\xE7\xF5es de Uso</link></u> da Adjoe."
