    - Term: CashbackOffers/HowItWork/Desc
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "1. Just make any in-game purchase in any adjoe game you like\n2. Send us
        a proof of purchase\n3. Purchase validation after 72 hours \n4. Get {0} coins"
      - "1. \u597D\u304D\u306A adjoe \u30B2\u30FC\u30E0\u3067\u30B2\u30FC\u30E0\u5185\u8CFC\u5165\u3092\u884C\u3046\n2.
        \u8CFC\u5165\u8A3C\u660E\u3092\u9001\u4FE1\u3059\u308B\n3. 72\u6642\u9593\u5F8C\u306B\u8CFC\u5165\u304C\u691C\u8A3C\u3055\u308C\u308B\n4.
        {0} \u30B3\u30A4\u30F3\u3092\u53D7\u3051\u53D6\u308B"
      - "1. \uC6D0\uD558\uB294 adjoe \uAC8C\uC784\uC5D0\uC11C \uC778\uAC8C\uC784
        \uAD6C\uB9E4\uB97C \uC9C4\uD589\uD558\uC138\uC694\n2. \uAD6C\uB9E4 \uC99D\uBE59\uC744
        \uBCF4\uB0B4\uC8FC\uC138\uC694\n3. 72\uC2DC\uAC04 \uD6C4 \uAD6C\uB9E4\uAC00
        \uAC80\uC99D\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4\n4. {0} \uCF54\uC778\uC744 \uBC1B\uC73C\uC138\uC694"
      - "1. Effectuez simplement un achat dans le jeu adjoe de votre choix\n2. Envoyez-nous
        une preuve d'achat\n3. Validation de l'achat apr\xE8s 72 heures\n4. Obtenez
        {0} pi\xE8ces"
      - "1. Simplemente realiza cualquier compra dentro del juego en cualquier juego
        de adjoe que te guste\r\n2. Env\xEDanos un comprobante de compra\r\n3. Validaci\xF3n
        de la compra despu\xE9s de 72 horas\r\n4. Obt\xE9n {0} monedas"
      - '1. Effettua un acquisto in-game in qualsiasi gioco adjoe che ti piace

        2.
        Inviaci una prova di acquisto

        3. Convalida dell''acquisto dopo
        72 ore

        4. Ottieni {0} monete'
      - "1. Basta fazer qualquer compra dentro do jogo em qualquer jogo da adjoe
        que voc\xEA gostar\n2. Envie-nos um comprovante de compra\n3. Valida\xE7\xE3o
        da compra ap\xF3s 72 horas\n4. Receba {0} moedas"
      Flags: 00000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
