    - Term: Payout/Disclaimers
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "Disclaimers\n\nThe merchants represented are not sponsors of the rewards
        or otherwise affiliated with us. The Logos and other identifying marks attached
        are trademarks of and owned by each represented company and/or its affiliates.
        Please visit each company\u2019s website for additional terms and conditions."
      - "\u514D\u8CAC\u4E8B\u9805\r\n\r\n\u7D39\u4ECB\u3055\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u5546\u5E97\u306F\u7279\u5178\u306E\u30B9\u30DD\u30F3\u30B5\u30FC\u3067\u306F\u306A\u304F\u3001\u5F53\u793E\u3068\u63D0\u643A\u95A2\u4FC2\u306B\u3082\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002\u6DFB\u4ED8\u3055\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u30ED\u30B4\u304A\u3088\u3073\u305D\u306E\u4ED6\u306E\u8B58\u5225\u30DE\u30FC\u30AF\u306F\u3001\u7D39\u4ECB\u3055\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u5404\u4F01\u696D\u304A\u3088\u3073/\u307E\u305F\u306F\u305D\u306E\u95A2\u9023\u4F1A\u793E\u306E\u5546\u6A19\u3067\u3042\u308A\u3001\u6240\u6709\u3055\u308C\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\u8FFD\u52A0\u306E\u5229\u7528\u898F\u7D04\u306B\u3064\u3044\u3066\u306F\u3001\u5404\u4F01\u696D\u306E
        Web \u30B5\u30A4\u30C8\u3092\u3054\u89A7\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002"
      - "\uBA74\uCC45 \uC870\uD56D\n\n\uD45C\uC2DC\uB41C \uC0C1\uC778\uC740 \uBCF4\uC0C1\uC758
        \uC2A4\uD3F0\uC11C\uAC00 \uC544\uB2C8\uBA70 \uB2E4\uB978 \uBC29\uC2DD\uC73C\uB85C
        \uB2F9\uC0AC\uC640 \uC81C\uD734\uD558\uC9C0 \uC54A\uC558\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uCCA8\uBD80\uB41C \uB85C\uACE0 \uBC0F \uAE30\uD0C0 \uC2DD\uBCC4 \uD45C\uC2DC\uB294
        \uAC01 \uD45C\uC2DC\uB41C \uD68C\uC0AC \uBC0F/\uB610\uB294 \uACC4\uC5F4\uC0AC\uC758
        \uC0C1\uD45C\uC774\uBA70 \uC18C\uC720\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uCD94\uAC00 \uC57D\uAD00\uC740
        \uAC01 \uD68C\uC0AC\uC758 \uC6F9\uC0AC\uC774\uD2B8\uB97C \uBC29\uBB38\uD558\uC138\uC694."
      - "Disclaimers\n\nThe merchants represented are not sponsors of the rewards
        or otherwise affiliated with us. The Logos and other identifying marks attached
        are trademarks of and owned by each represented company and/or its affiliates.
        Please visit each company\u2019s website for additional terms and conditions."
      - "Disclaimers\n\nThe merchants represented are not sponsors of the rewards
        or otherwise affiliated with us. The Logos and other identifying marks attached
        are trademarks of and owned by each represented company and/or its affiliates.
        Please visit each company\u2019s website for additional terms and conditions."
      - "Disclaimer\n\nI commercianti rappresentati non sono sponsor dei premi o
        altrimenti affiliati a noi. I loghi e gli altri segni identificativi allegati
        sono marchi di fabbrica di e di propriet\xE0 di ciascuna societ\xE0 rappresentata
        e/o delle sue affiliate. Ti invitiamo a visitare il sito web di ciascuna
        azienda per ulteriori termini e condizioni."
      - "Isen\xE7\xF5es de responsabilidade\n\nOs comerciantes representados n\xE3o
        s\xE3o patrocinadores das recompensas nem s\xE3o afiliados a n\xF3s. Os logotipos
        e outras marcas de identifica\xE7\xE3o anexadas s\xE3o marcas registradas
        e pertencem a cada empresa representada e/ou \xE0s suas afiliadas. Visite
        o site de cada empresa para consultar termos e condi\xE7\xF5es adicionais."
      Flags: 00000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
