    - Term: PayoutHistory/HowToReceive
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "How to receive my reward?\nYou will receive an email from \u2018Your Digital
        Reward\u2019 (or \"Tremendous\" for PayPal) in your mailbox. Simply click
        on \u201CClaim your reward\u201D at the bottom of the email and enter your
        account information."
      - "\u5831\u916C\u3092\u53D7\u3051\u53D6\u308B\u306B\u306F\u3069\u3046\u3059\u308C\u3070\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3059\u304B?\n\u30E1\u30FC\u30EB\u30DC\u30C3\u30AF\u30B9\u306B\u300CYour
        Digital Reward\u300D\u304B\u3089\u306E\u30E1\u30FC\u30EB\u304C\u5C4A\u304D\u307E\u3059\u3002\u30E1\u30FC\u30EB\u306E\u4E0B\u90E8\u306B\u3042\u308B\u300CClaim
        Your Reward\u300D\u3092\u30AF\u30EA\u30C3\u30AF\u3057\u3001\u30A2\u30AB\u30A6\u30F3\u30C8\u60C5\u5831\u3092\u5165\u529B\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002"
      - "\uBCF4\uC0C1\uC744 \uBC1B\uC73C\uB824\uBA74 \uC5B4\uB5BB\uAC8C\uD574\uC57C\uD569\uB2C8\uAE4C?\n\uC0AC\uC11C\uD568\uC5D0
        'Your Digital Reward'\uC758 \uC774\uBA54\uC77C\uC774 \uC804\uC1A1\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC774\uBA54\uC77C \uD558\uB2E8\uC758 'Claim Your Reward'\uB97C \uD074\uB9AD\uD558\uACE0
        \uACC4\uC815 \uC815\uBCF4\uB97C \uC785\uB825\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      - "<color=#3C62DD><font-weight=\"600\">Comment recevoir ma r\xE9compense\_?</font-weight></color>\nVous
        avez re\xE7u un e-mail de \"Your Digital Reward\" (ou \"Tremendous\" pour
        PayPal) dans votre bo\xEEte de r\xE9ception. Cliquez simplement sur \xABClaim
        Your Reward\xBB au bas de l'e-mail et saisissez les informations de votre
        compte."
      - "<color=#3C62DD><font-weight=\"600\">C\xF3mo recibir mi recompensa?</font-weight></color>\nRecibi\xF3
        un correo electr\xF3nico de \"Your Digital Reward\" (o \"Tremendous\" para
        PayPal) en su casilla de correo. Simplemente haga clic en \"Claim Your Reward\"
        en la parte inferior del correo electr\xF3nico e ingrese la informaci\xF3n
        de su cuenta."
      - '<color=#3C62DD><font-weight="600">Come ricevo il mio premio?</font-weight></color>

        Hai
        ricevuto un''e-mail da "Your Digital Reward" (o "Tremendous" per PayPal)
        nella tua casella di posta. Basta fare clic su "Claim Your Reward" nella
        parte inferiore dell''e-mail e inserire le informazioni del tuo account.'
      - "<color=#3C62DD><font-weight=\"600\">Como receber minha recompensa?</font-weight></color>\nVoc\xEA
        recebeu um e-mail de \"Your Digital Reward\" (ou \"Tremendous\" para PayPal)
        na sua caixa de entrada. Basta clicar em \"Claim Your Reward\" na parte inferior
        do e-mail e inserir as informa\xE7\xF5es da sua conta."
      Flags: 00000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
