    - Term: PayoutWindow/Desc
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "You will receive an email from \u2018Your Digital Reward\u2019 in your inbox.
        \nIn order to receive your gift card click on \u2018Claim Your Reward\u2019.\nDon\u2019t
        forget to check your Spam folder."
      - "\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u53D7\u4FE1\u7BB1\u306B\u300CYour Digital Reward\u300D\u304B\u3089\u306E\u30E1\u30FC\u30EB\u304C\u5C4A\u304D\u307E\u3059\u3002\n\u30AE\u30D5\u30C8\u30AB\u30FC\u30C9\u3092\u53D7\u3051\u53D6\u308B\u306B\u306F\u3001\u300CClaim
        Your Reward\u300D\u3092\u30AF\u30EA\u30C3\u30AF\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002\n\u30B9\u30D1\u30E0\u30D5\u30A9\u30EB\u30C0\u3082\u5FD8\u308C\u305A\u306B\u78BA\u8A8D\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002"
      - "\uBC1B\uC740 \uD3B8\uC9C0\uD568\uC5D0\uC11C '\uB514\uC9C0\uD138 \uBCF4\uC0C1'
        \uC774\uBA54\uC77C\uC744 \uBC1B\uAC8C \uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4.\n\uAE30\uD504\uD2B8
        \uCE74\uB4DC\uB97C \uBC1B\uC73C\uB824\uBA74 '\uBCF4\uC0C1 \uCCAD\uAD6C'\uB97C
        \uD074\uB9AD\uD558\uC138\uC694.\n\uC2A4\uD338 \uD3F4\uB354\uB97C \uD655\uC778\uD558\uB294
        \uAC83\uC744 \uC78A\uC9C0 \uB9C8\uC138\uC694."
      - "You will recieve an email from \u2018Your Digital Reward\u2019 in your inbox.
        \nIn order to receive your gift card click on \u2018Claim Your Reward\u2019.\nDon\u2019t
        forget to check your Spam folder."
      - "You will recieve an email from \u2018Your Digital Reward\u2019 in your inbox.
        \nIn order to receive your gift card click on \u2018Claim Your Reward\u2019.\nDon\u2019t
        forget to check your Spam folder."
      - 'Riceverai un''email da "Il tuo premio digitale" nella tua casella di posta.

        Per
        ricevere la tua carta regalo, clicca su "Richiedi il tuo premio".

        Non
        dimenticare di controllare la cartella Spam.'
      - "Voc\xEA receber\xE1 um e-mail de \u2018Your Digital Reward\u2019 na sua
        caixa de entrada. \nPara receber seu cart\xE3o-presente, clique em \u2018Claim
        Your Reward\u2019.\nN\xE3o se esque\xE7a de verificar sua pasta de Spam."
      Flags: 00000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
