    - Term: PayoutWindow/DesclaimerPaypal
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "You <b>promptly</b> receive an <b>email from Tremendous</b> with a link
        to confirm your PayPal address and receive your reward. Don\u2019t forget
        to check <b>your inbox and Spam</b> folder.\n\nDelivery time: instant"
      - "<b>\u8FC5\u901F\u306B</b> <b>Tremendous\u304B\u3089\u306E\u30E1\u30FC\u30EB</b>
        \u3092\u53D7\u3051\u53D6\u308A\u3001PayPal\u30A2\u30C9\u30EC\u30B9\u3092\u78BA\u8A8D\u3057\u3066\u30EA\u30EF\u30FC\u30C9\u3092\u53D7\u3051\u53D6\u308B\u305F\u3081\u306E\u30EA\u30F3\u30AF\u304C\u5C4A\u304D\u307E\u3059\u3002 
        \n<b>\u53D7\u4FE1\u30C8\u30EC\u30A4\u3068\u8FF7\u60D1\u30E1\u30FC\u30EB</b>
        \u30D5\u30A9\u30EB\u30C0\u3092\u5FD8\u308C\u305A\u306B\u78BA\u8A8D\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002 
        \n\n\u914D\u4FE1\u6642\u9593\uFF1A\u5373\u6642"
      - "<b>\uC989\uC2DC</b> <b>Tremendous\uB85C\uBD80\uD130 \uC774\uBA54\uC77C</b>\uC744
        \uBC1B\uC544 PayPal \uC8FC\uC18C\uB97C \uD655\uC778\uD558\uACE0 \uB9AC\uC6CC\uB4DC\uB97C
        \uBC1B\uC744 \uC218 \uC788\uB294 \uB9C1\uD06C\uAC00 \uC804\uC1A1\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4. 
        \r\n<b>\uBC1B\uC740\uD3B8\uC9C0\uD568\uACFC \uC2A4\uD338\uD568</b>\uC744
        \uAF2D \uD655\uC778\uD558\uC138\uC694.  \r\n\r\n\uBC30\uC1A1 \uC2DC\uAC04:
        \uC989\uC2DC"
      - "Vous recevrez <b>imm\xE9diatement</b> un <b>mail</b> de <b>Tremendous</b>
        contenant <b>un lien pour confirmer</b> votre adresse PayPal et recevoir
        votre r\xE9compense. N'oubliez pas de v\xE9rifier votre <b>bo\xEEte de r\xE9ception
        et vos spams</b>.\n\nD\xE9lai de livraison\_: imm\xE9diat."
      - "Recibir\xE1s inmediatamente un <b>correo electr\xF3nico</b> de <b>Tremendous</b>
        con un enlace para confirmar tu direcci\xF3n de PayPal y recibir tu recompensa.
        No olvides revisar tu bandeja de entrada y la <b>carpeta de correo no deseado</b>.\n\nTiempo
        de entrega: instantaneo"
      - 'Riceverai <b>immediatamente</b> un''<b>email da Tremendous</b> con un link
        per confermare il tuo indirizzo PayPal e ricevere il tuo premio. Non dimenticare
        di controllare la <b>posta in arrivo</b> e la cartella Spam.


        Tempi
        di consegna: immediati'
      - "Voc\xEA receber\xE1 imediatamente um <b>e-mail</b> da <b>Tremendous</b>
        com um link para confirmar seu endere\xE7o do PayPal e receber sua recompensa.
        N\xE3o se esque\xE7a de verificar sua caixa de entrada e a <b>pasta de spam</b>.\n\nTempo
        de entrega: instant\xE2neo"
      Flags: 00000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Popup/AccessRestricted
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Access Restricted. Please send your user ID to reward@plus-games.com
      - "\u30A2\u30AF\u30BB\u30B9\u5236\u9650\u304C\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002ID
        \u3092 reward@plus-games.com \u307E\u3067\u9001\u4FE1\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044"
