    - Term: PaypalTutorial/1/Desc
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You received an email from <color=#EC521D>Tremendous</color> with a link
        to access your Reward
      - "<color=#EC521D>Tremendous</color> \u304B\u3089\u30EA\u30EF\u30FC\u30C9\u306B\u30A2\u30AF\u30BB\u30B9\u3059\u308B\u305F\u3081\u306E\u30EA\u30F3\u30AF\u4ED8\u304D\u30E1\u30FC\u30EB\u3092\u53D7\u3051\u53D6\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F"
      - "<color=#EC521D>Tremendous</color> \uC5D0\uC11C \uB9AC\uC6CC\uB4DC\uC5D0
        \uC811\uADFC\uD560 \uC218 \uC788\uB294 \uB9C1\uD06C\uAC00 \uD3EC\uD568\uB41C
        \uC774\uBA54\uC77C\uC744 \uBC1B\uC558\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4"
      - "Vous avez re\xE7u un mail de <color=#EC521D>Tremendous</color> contenant
        un lien pour acc\xE9der \xE0 votre r\xE9compense."
      - "Recibiste un correo electr\xF3nico de <color=#EC521D>Tremendous</color>
        con un enlace para acceder a tu recompensa."
      - Hai ricevuto un'email da <color=#EC521D>Tremendous</color> con un link per
        accedere al tuo premio
      - "Voc\xEA recebeu um e-mail da <color=#EC521D>Tremendous</color> com um link
        para acessar sua recompensa."
      Flags: 00000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: PaypalTutorial/2/Desc
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Open the email and click on <color=#EC521D>Redeem</color>  button
      - "\u30E1\u30FC\u30EB\u3092\u958B\u3044\u3066 <color=#EC521D>Redeem</color>
        \u30DC\u30BF\u30F3\u3092\u30AF\u30EA\u30C3\u30AF\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044"
      - "\uC774\uBA54\uC77C\uC744 \uC5F4\uACE0 <color=#EC521D>Redeem</color> \uBC84\uD2BC\uC744
        \uD074\uB9AD\uD558\uC138\uC694"
      - Ouvrez le mail et cliquez sur le bouton <color=#EC521D>Redeem</color>.
      - "Abre el correo electr\xF3nico y haz clic en el bot\xF3n <color=#EC521D>Redeem</color>."
      - Apri l'email e clicca sul pulsante <color=#EC521D>Redeem</color>
      - "Abra o e-mail e clique no bot\xE3o <color=#EC521D>Redeem</color>."
      Flags: 00000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: PaypalTutorial/3/Desc
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - enter your paypal and click on <color=#EC521D>transfer</color>  button
      - "PayPal \u3092\u5165\u529B\u3057\u3001<color=#EC521D>transfer</color> \u30DC\u30BF\u30F3\u3092\u30AF\u30EA\u30C3\u30AF\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044"
      - "PayPal \uC744 \uC785\uB825\uD558\uACE0 <color=#EC521D>transfer</color> \uBC84\uD2BC\uC744
        \uD074\uB9AD\uD558\uC138\uC694"
      - "Connectez-vous \xE0 votre compte PayPal et cliquez sur le bouton <color=#EC521D>Transfer</color>."
      - "Ingresa tu cuenta de PayPal y haz clic en el bot\xF3n <color=#EC521D>Transfer</color>."
      - Inserisci il tuo account PayPal e clicca sul pulsante <color=#EC521D>Trasfer</color>
      - "Digite sua conta do PayPal e clique no bot\xE3o <color=#EC521D>Transfer</color>."
      Flags: 00000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: PaypalTutorial/4/Desc
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - In most cases, the transfer takes just <color=#EC521D>a couple of minutes</color>
        to be sent to you
      - "\u307B\u3068\u3093\u3069\u306E\u5834\u5408\u3001\u9001\u91D1\u306F <color=#EC521D>\u6570\u5206</color>
        \u4EE5\u5185\u306B\u5B8C\u4E86\u3057\u307E\u3059"
      - "\uB300\uBD80\uBD84\uC758 \uACBD\uC6B0 \uC804\uC1A1\uC740 <color=#EC521D>\uBA87
        \uBD84</color> \uC548\uC5D0 \uC644\uB8CC\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4"
      - Dans la plupart des cas, le virement ne prend que <color=#EC521D>quelques
        minutes</color>.
      - "En la mayor\xEDa de los casos, la transferencia solo tarda <color=#EC521D>un
        par de minutos</color> en enviarse."
      - Nella maggior parte dei casi, il trasferimento richiede solo <color=#EC521D>un
        paio di minuti</color> per essere inviato
      - "Na maioria dos casos, a transfer\xEAncia leva apenas <color=#EC521D>alguns
        minutos</color> para ser enviada."
      Flags: 00000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: OtherGiftcardsTutorial/1/Desc
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You received an email from <color=#EC521D>Tremendous</color>  with a link
        to access your Reward
      - "<color=#EC521D>Tremendous</color> \u304B\u3089\u30EA\u30EF\u30FC\u30C9\u306B\u30A2\u30AF\u30BB\u30B9\u3059\u308B\u305F\u3081\u306E\u30EA\u30F3\u30AF\u4ED8\u304D\u30E1\u30FC\u30EB\u3092\u53D7\u3051\u53D6\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F"
      - "<color=#EC521D>Tremendous</color> \uC5D0\uC11C \uB9AC\uC6CC\uB4DC\uC5D0
        \uC811\uADFC\uD560 \uC218 \uC788\uB294 \uB9C1\uD06C\uAC00 \uD3EC\uD568\uB41C
        \uC774\uBA54\uC77C\uC744 \uBC1B\uC558\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4"
      - "Vous avez re\xE7u un mail de <color=#EC521D>Tremendous</color> contenant
        un lien pour acc\xE9der \xE0 votre r\xE9compense."
      - "Recibiste un correo electr\xF3nico de <color=#EC521D>Tremendous</color>
        con un enlace para acceder a tu recompensa."
      - Hai ricevuto un'email da <color=#EC521D>Tremendous</color> con un link per
