    - Term: Leaderboard/PopupInfo/Desc
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Players are ranked by the coins they earn during the current week. Earn coins
        by completing offers. The leaderboard resets every week.
      - "\u30D7\u30EC\u30A4\u30E4\u30FC\u306F\u4ECA\u9031\u7372\u5F97\u3057\u305F\u30B3\u30A4\u30F3\u6570\u3067\u9806\u4F4D\u4ED8\u3051\u3055\u308C\u307E\u3059\u3002\u30AA\u30D5\u30A1\u30FC\u3092\u5B8C\u4E86\u3057\u3066\u30B3\u30A4\u30F3\u3092\u7372\u5F97\u3057\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002\u30E9\u30F3\u30AD\u30F3\u30B0\u306F\u6BCE\u9031\u30EA\u30BB\u30C3\u30C8\u3055\u308C\u307E\u3059\u3002"
      - "\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4\uB294 \uC774\uBC88 \uC8FC \uB3D9\uC548 \uD68D\uB4DD\uD55C
        \uCF54\uC778 \uC218\uC5D0 \uB530\uB77C \uC21C\uC704\uAC00 \uB9E4\uACA8\uC9D1\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC624\uD37C\uB97C \uC644\uB8CC\uD558\uC5EC \uCF54\uC778\uC744 \uD68D\uB4DD\uD558\uC138\uC694.
        \uB9AC\uB354\uBCF4\uB4DC\uB294 \uB9E4\uC8FC \uCD08\uAE30\uD654\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      - "Les joueurs sont class\xE9s en fonction des pi\xE8ces qu\u2019ils gagnent
        pendant la semaine en cours. Gagnez des pi\xE8ces en compl\xE9tant des offres.
        Le classement est r\xE9initialis\xE9 chaque semaine."
      - "Los jugadores se clasifican seg\xFAn las monedas que ganan durante la semana
        actual. Gana monedas completando ofertas. La clasificaci\xF3n se reinicia
        cada semana."
      - I giocatori vengono classificati in base alle monete guadagnate durante la
        settimana corrente. Guadagna monete completando le offerte. La classifica
        si azzera ogni settimana.
      - "Os jogadores s\xE3o classificados de acordo com as moedas que ganham durante
        a semana atual. Ganhe moedas completando ofertas. A classifica\xE7\xE3o \xE9
        reiniciada toda semana."
      Flags: 00000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
