    - Term: Popup/DailyStreakNotification/Desc
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "We\u2019ll remind you to claim 50 coins every day and keep your 7-day bonus."
      - "\u6BCE\u65E550\u30B3\u30A4\u30F3\u3092\u53D7\u3051\u53D6\u308A\u30017\u65E5\u9593\u30DC\u30FC\u30CA\u30B9\u3092\u7DAD\u6301\u3067\u304D\u308B\u3088\u3046\u30EA\u30DE\u30A4\u30F3\u30C9\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002"
      - "\uB9E4\uC77C 50\uCF54\uC778\uC744 \uBC1B\uB294 \uAC83\uACFC 7\uC77C \uBCF4\uB108\uC2A4\uB97C
        \uC720\uC9C0\uD558\uB294 \uAC83\uC744 \uC54C\uB824\uB4DC\uB9B4\uAC8C\uC694."
      - "Nous vous rappellerons de r\xE9clamer 50 pi\xE8ces chaque jour et de conserver
        votre bonus de 7 jours."
      - "Te recordaremos que reclames 50 monedas cada d\xEDa y mantengas tu bono
        de 7 d\xEDas."
      - Ti ricorderemo di riscattare 50 monete ogni giorno e mantenere il tuo bonus
        di 7 giorni.
      - "Vamos lembrar voc\xEA de resgatar 50 moedas todos os dias e manter seu b\xF4nus
        de 7 dias."
      Flags: 00000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
