    - Term: Popup/MissionCompleted/Desc
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "You\u2019ve completed your first mission. Open Missions to discover more
        tasks and earn extra rewards."
      - "\u6700\u521D\u306E\u30DF\u30C3\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u3092\u5B8C\u4E86\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u30DF\u30C3\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u3092\u958B\u3044\u3066\u3001\u3055\u3089\u306B\u591A\u304F\u306E\u30BF\u30B9\u30AF\u3092\u898B\u3064\u3051\u3001\u8FFD\u52A0\u30EA\u30EF\u30FC\u30C9\u3092\u7372\u5F97\u3057\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002"
      - "\uCCAB \uBC88\uC9F8 \uBBF8\uC158\uC744 \uC644\uB8CC\uD588\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uBBF8\uC158\uC744 \uC5F4\uC5B4 \uB354 \uB9CE\uC740 \uACFC\uC81C\uB97C \uD655\uC778\uD558\uACE0
        \uCD94\uAC00 \uBCF4\uC0C1\uC744 \uD68D\uB4DD\uD558\uC138\uC694."
      - "Vous avez termin\xE9 votre premi\xE8re mission. Ouvrez les Missions pour
        d\xE9couvrir plus de t\xE2ches et gagner des r\xE9compenses suppl\xE9mentaires."
      - "Has completado tu primera misi\xF3n. Abre Misiones para descubrir m\xE1s
        tareas y ganar recompensas extra."
      - "Hai completato la tua prima missione. Apri Missioni per scoprire altre attivit\xE0
        e ottenere ricompense extra."
      - "Voc\xEA concluiu sua primeira miss\xE3o. Abra Miss\xF5es para descobrir
        mais tarefas e ganhar recompensas extras."
      Flags: 00000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Popup/MissionCompleted/Button
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - OPEN MISSIONS
      - "\u30DF\u30C3\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u3092\u958B\u304F"
      - "\uBBF8\uC158 \uC5F4\uAE30"
      - OUVRIR LES MISSIONS
      - ABRIR MISIONES
      - APRI MISSIONI
      - "ABRIR MISS\xD5ES"
      Flags: 00000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Popup/PayoutSlotLimit/Desc
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "PayPal payouts under $0.50 are designed as quick test payouts, so you can
        see that rewards really work.\n\nBecause small PayPal transfers have high
        fees, they\u2019re available only a limited number of times. Larger PayPal
        payouts are usually the better option and are available without any limits.\n\nYou\u2019ll
        always receive every reward you earn, no matter the amount."
      - "0.50\u30C9\u30EB\u672A\u6E80\u306EPayPal\u652F\u6255\u3044\u306F\u3001\u5831\u916C\u304C\u5B9F\u969B\u306B\u6A5F\u80FD\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3092\u3059\u3070\u3084\u304F\u78BA\u8A8D\u3067\u304D\u308B\u30C6\u30B9\u30C8\u652F\u6255\u3044\u3068\u3057\u3066\u8A2D\u8A08\u3055\u308C\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\n\n\u5C11\u984D\u306EPayPal\u9001\u91D1\u306B\u306F\u9AD8\u3044\u624B\u6570\u6599\u304C\u304B\u304B\u308B\u305F\u3081\u3001\u3053\u308C\u3089\u306E\u652F\u6255\u3044\u30AA\u30D7\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u306F\u9650\u3089\u308C\u305F\u56DE\u6570\u306E\u307F\u5229\u7528\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3059\u3002\u3088\u308A\u5927\u304D\u306A\u91D1\u984D\u306EPayPal\u652F\u6255\u3044\u306F\u901A\u5E38\u3088\u308A\u826F\u3044\u9078\u629E\u80A2\u3067\u3042\u308A\u3001\u5236\u9650\u306A\u304F\u5229\u7528\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3059\u3002\n\n\u7372\u5F97\u3057\u305F\u5831\u916C\u306F\u3001\u91D1\u984D\u306B\u304B\u304B\u308F\u3089\u305A\u5FC5\u305A\u53D7\u3051\u53D6\u308B\u3053\u3068\u304C\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3059\u3002"
      - "0.50\uB2EC\uB7EC \uBBF8\uB9CC\uC758 PayPal \uC9C0\uAE09\uC740 \uBE60\uB978
        \uD14C\uC2A4\uD2B8 \uC9C0\uAE09\uC6A9\uC73C\uB85C \uC124\uACC4\uB418\uC5B4,
        \uBCF4\uC0C1\uC774 \uC2E4\uC81C\uB85C \uC9C0\uAE09\uB41C\uB2E4\uB294 \uAC83\uC744
        \uD655\uC778\uD560 \uC218 \uC788\uB3C4\uB85D \uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4.\n\n\uC18C\uC561
        PayPal \uC1A1\uAE08\uC5D0\uB294 \uB192\uC740 \uC218\uC218\uB8CC\uAC00 \uBC1C\uC0DD\uD558\uAE30
        \uB54C\uBB38\uC5D0, \uD574\uB2F9 \uC9C0\uAE09 \uC635\uC158\uC740 \uC81C\uD55C\uB41C
        \uD69F\uC218\uB9CC \uC774\uC6A9\uD560 \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uB354
        \uD070 \uAE08\uC561\uC758 PayPal \uC9C0\uAE09\uC740 \uC77C\uBC18\uC801\uC73C\uB85C
        \uB354 \uC88B\uC740 \uC120\uD0DD\uC774\uBA70, \uC81C\uD55C \uC5C6\uC774 \uC774\uC6A9\uD560
        \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.\n\n\uD68D\uB4DD\uD55C \uBCF4\uC0C1\uC740
        \uAE08\uC561\uACFC \uAD00\uACC4\uC5C6\uC774 \uD56D\uC0C1 \uBC1B\uC73C\uC2E4
        \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      - "Les versements PayPal de moins de 0,45 \u20AC sont con\xE7us comme des versements
        de test rapides, afin que vous puissiez constater que les r\xE9compenses
        fonctionnent r\xE9ellement.\n\nComme les petits transferts PayPal entra\xEEnent
        des frais \xE9lev\xE9s, ils ne sont disponibles qu\u2019un nombre limit\xE9
        de fois. Les versements PayPal plus \xE9lev\xE9s sont g\xE9n\xE9ralement
        une meilleure option et sont disponibles sans aucune limite.\n\nVous recevrez
        toujours chaque r\xE9compense que vous gagnez, quel que soit son montant."
      - "Los pagos de PayPal inferiores a 0,50 US$ est\xE1n dise\xF1ados como pagos
        de prueba r\xE1pidos, para que puedas comprobar que las recompensas realmente
        funcionan.\n\nComo las transferencias peque\xF1as de PayPal tienen comisiones
        elevadas, solo est\xE1n disponibles un n\xFAmero limitado de veces. Los pagos
        de PayPal m\xE1s altos suelen ser una mejor opci\xF3n y est\xE1n disponibles
        sin ning\xFAn l\xEDmite.\n\nSiempre recibir\xE1s cada recompensa que ganes,
        sin importar el importe."
      - "I pagamenti PayPal inferiori a 0,50 \u20AC sono pensati come pagamenti di
        prova rapidi, cos\xEC puoi vedere che le ricompense funzionano davvero.\n\nPoich\xE9
        i piccoli trasferimenti PayPal hanno commissioni elevate, sono disponibili
        solo un numero limitato di volte. I pagamenti PayPal di importo maggiore
        sono di solito l\u2019opzione migliore e sono disponibili senza alcun limite.\n\nRiceverai
        sempre ogni ricompensa guadagnata, indipendentemente dall\u2019importo."
      - "Os pagamentos PayPal inferiores a US$ 0,50 foram criados como pagamentos
        de teste r\xE1pidos, para que voc\xEA possa ver que as recompensas realmente
        funcionam.\n\nComo pequenas transfer\xEAncias PayPal t\xEAm taxas elevadas,
        elas est\xE3o dispon\xEDveis apenas um n\xFAmero limitado de vezes. Pagamentos
        PayPal de valores maiores geralmente s\xE3o a melhor op\xE7\xE3o e est\xE3o
        dispon\xEDveis sem nenhum limite.\n\nVoc\xEA sempre receber\xE1 todas as
        recompensas que ganhar, independentemente do valor."
